{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-30", "prepared_on": "2026-10-30", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-30</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic is asking Wall Street to believe in AGI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 要華爾街相信 AGI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">An analyst at SemiAnalysis digs into the numbers in Anthropic's S-1 filing to go public on the Nasdaq.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">SemiAnalysis 分析師解讀 Anthropic 向那斯達克遞交的 S-1 上市文件中的財務數字。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/podcast/1021322/anthropic-ipo-filing-s-1-claude-semianalysis-joey-brookhart-interview\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Mistral releases weights for its trillion-parameter AI model, targeting cybersecurity<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Mistral 釋出兆級參數模型權重，主打資安應用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Mistral says the new model gives organizations a level of control over their cyber defenses that closed models can't.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Mistral 表示，新模型能讓組織掌控自身的資安防禦，這是封閉模型做不到的。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/29/mistral-releases-weights-for-its-trillion-parameter-ai-model-targeting-cybersecurity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google announces Gemini 4 Carbon, its latest frontier AI model that you can't use<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 發表最新前沿模型 Gemini 4 Carbon，但一般人還不能用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Carbon is essentially a slightly better version of Argon.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Carbon 基本上是 Argon 的小幅升級版。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/10/google-announces-gemini-4-carbon-its-latest-frontier-ai-model-that-you-cant-use/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Microsoft's AI future has fewer jobs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟的 AI 未來，工作機會更少</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft is offering voluntary buyouts to around 60,000 employees, a sign AI is about to change the size of its workforce.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟向約 6 萬名員工提供自願離職方案，顯示 AI 即將改變公司的人力規模。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/1022023/microsoft-exit-offer-layoffs-notepad\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> A Defense Contractor Gave Their Personal AI Agent Access to a Secure Pentagon System<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">國防承包商讓個人 AI 代理存取五角大廈安全系統</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sources say an Accenture employee's personal Claude agent ran on a DOD network for two months before it was identified and the vulnerability patched.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">消息人士指出，埃森哲一名員工的個人 Claude 代理在國防部網路上運行了兩個月，才被發現並修補漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/a-defense-contractor-gave-their-personal-ai-agent-access-to-a-secure-pentagon-system/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenAI-backed Thrive Holdings acquires ADT<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 支持的 Thrive Holdings 收購 ADT</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Thrive Holdings is buying ADT in a $15.3 billion deal, with plans to bring AI to the home security business.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Thrive Holdings 以 153 億美元收購 ADT，計畫把 AI 導入居家安防業務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/29/openai-backed-thrive-holdings-acquires-adt/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Malicious Markdown guide file tries to trick Codex into installing a malicious package<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">惡意 Markdown 指引檔企圖誘使 Codex 安裝惡意套件</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Forever Security found a malicious AGENTS.md that tried to get OpenAI Codex to change settings and install the malicious NPM package function-color; security controls blocked the install.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Forever Security 發現惡意 AGENTS.md，企圖誘使 Codex 修改設定並安裝惡意 NPM 套件 function-color，資安防護已阻止安裝。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180033\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Trump declares robot imports a national security threat<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">川普宣布進口機器人構成國安威脅</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The president ordered trade talks on foreign-made factory robots and threatened tariffs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">總統下令就外國製工廠機器人展開貿易談判，並威脅課徵關稅。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/10/trump-declares-robot-imports-a-national-security-threat/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> An updated Model Spec for more capable and beneficial AI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 更新 Model Spec，迎接更強大且有益的 AI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI's updated Model Spec outlines five core values to guide more capable AI toward sound judgment, human agency, and faithfulness to human intent.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 更新後的 Model Spec 提出五項核心價值，引導更強大的 AI 具備良好判斷、尊重人的自主，並忠於人類意圖。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/updated-model-spec\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> You can generate and edit Google Docs files directly in Gemini chats now<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">現在可直接在 Gemini 對話中產生並編輯 Google 文件</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini can now generate, preview, and edit PDFs, Docs, Sheets, slide decks, Markdown, TXT files, and code, available today to all users.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 現可產生、預覽並編輯 PDF、文件、試算表、簡報、Markdown、TXT 與程式碼，今天起對所有使用者開放。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1022519/google-gemini-file-editing-documents-pdfs\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}